<span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-40 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow"><h2><strong>ZHANGJIAKOU SENO TESTING CENTER CO., LTD</strong></h2><p>One of the best avian genetic testing laboratories in China, offering global sample testing services, as well as equipment and reagent sales. Fast, efficient, and highly accurate.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:1100px"><p>Located in Zhangjiakou (160 km northwest of Beijing), SENO operates at the heart of a thriving regional avian breeding hub. Benefiting from a high-altitude (1,000m) cool climate ideal for bio-testing, we deliver specialized, world-class avian genetic and molecular testing services to breeders, veterinary clinics, and international partners across the globe.</p></div></div><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:800px"><figure class="wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
