</div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:500px"><h2><strong>Intellectual Property &amp; Achievements</strong></h2><p>Our continuous innovation is backed by a robust IP portfolio:</p><p>Winner of the prestigious <strong>Hebei Provincial Science &amp; Technology Award (2023)</strong></p><p><strong>2</strong> Invention Patents &amp; <strong>18</strong> Utility Model Patents</p><p><strong>3</strong> Software Copyrights &amp; <strong>3</strong> IC Layout Designs</p></div></div><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column has-ast-global-color-4-color has-ast-global-color-1-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4a5b0d31 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="border-top-left-radius:15px;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)"><h2><strong>Our Mission</strong></h2><p>To provide <strong>accurate, efficient, and globally accessible bird DNA testing services</strong>, supporting breeders, researchers, and bird owners with reliable genetic insights.</p></div></div><p></p></div>`} />
